  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation on radiation protection, emergency preparedness and non-proliferation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbete inom str&#xe5;lskydd, beredskap och icke-spridning.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att fr&#xe4;mja utvecklingen av en mer l&#xe5;ngsiktig nationell struktur f&#xf6;r kunskaps&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring inom icke-spridning i Georgien, samt att &#xf6;ka kunskaperna och intresset f&#xf6;r icke-spridningsfr&#xe5;gor bland den georgiska allm&#xe4;nheten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the development of long term structures for knowledge transfer in the non-proliferation field, as well as to improve the knowledge of, and interest in, non-proliferation issues among the Georgian public.</narrative>
  </description>
